# Forever Enhancement Shaman (provisional: no in-game check yet; the totem slots, Lightning Shield's charges and the
# shocks' shared cooldown are modelled from our casts and the hits on us): the weapon imbue and the totems before
# combat; Grace of Air and Strength of Earth when their slot is empty and Searing Totem when the fire slot is, Lightning
# Shield when down and Flame Shock when it drops at tier 2; Fire Nova on Clearcasting and Lightning Bolt at 5 Maelstrom
# Weapon at tier 1; Stormstrike, Earth Shock and Fire Nova (after wowsims/forever's Enhancement APL, reference only).
# The mana potion, Demonic Rune and the Fire Nova filler's mana floor are settings, off by default.

actions.precombat=rockbiter_weapon,if=settings.imbue=1&!buff.main_hand_enchant.up
actions.precombat+=/flametongue_weapon,if=settings.imbue=2&!buff.main_hand_enchant.up
actions.precombat+=/windfury_weapon,if=settings.imbue=3&!buff.main_hand_enchant.up
actions.precombat+=/frostbrand_weapon,if=settings.imbue=4&!buff.main_hand_enchant.up
actions.precombat+=/lightning_shield,if=!buff.lightning_shield.up
actions.precombat+=/grace_of_air_totem,if=!totem.air.up
actions.precombat+=/flametongue_totem,if=!totem.fire.up
actions.precombat+=/strength_of_earth_totem,if=!totem.earth.up
actions.precombat+=/mana_spring_totem,if=!totem.water.up
actions=major_mana_potion,use_off_gcd=1,if=mana.pct<settings.potion_mana
actions+=/demonic_rune,use_off_gcd=1,if=mana.pct<settings.rune_mana
actions+=/grace_of_air_totem,focus=2,if=!totem.air.up
actions+=/strength_of_earth_totem,focus=2,if=!totem.earth.up
actions+=/fire_nova,focus=1,if=buff.clearcasting.up
actions+=/lightning_shield,focus=2,if=!buff.lightning_shield.up
actions+=/searing_totem,focus=2,if=!totem.fire.up
actions+=/stormstrike
actions+=/lightning_bolt,focus=1,if=buff.maelstrom_weapon.stack>=5
actions+=/flame_shock,focus=2,if=!debuff.flame_shock.up
actions+=/earth_shock
actions+=/fire_nova,if=mana.pct>=settings.fire_nova_mana
